{"name": "Tape Man", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Measure Your Way through the Maze!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Tape Man\" is a puzzle platformer packed with knowledge for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your measuring tape to explore a vast maze of puzzles. Your measure tapes work as a platform, an obstacle, and many other things\u2014it's for you to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051290/extras/36bd098e1e7b016002d0cc9f951aaafa.poster.avif?t=1781514333\" width=\"594\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051290/extras/36bd098e1e7b016002d0cc9f951aaafa.webm?t=1781514333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051290/extras/36bd098e1e7b016002d0cc9f951aaafa.mp4?t=1781514333\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn more about your tape measure.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only can a tape measure interact with different sorts of level elements, such as moving block, one-way platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also secrets in the tape measure itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051290/extras/15dc763996141a75ea492a38e51f46f2.poster.avif?t=1781514333\" width=\"594\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051290/extras/15dc763996141a75ea492a38e51f46f2.webm?t=1781514333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://sh